From 279fbb3c3b9b7ad343a3aef04375882126abfabb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:40:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): derive the gate job budget from available CPUs

Use the available CPU count with a floor of two and cap of 64.
Keep explicit overrides and print the source of the chosen budget.
Pin the CPU default, fallback, bounds and override behaviour.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2814
